    description: "Found by the 2026-10-20 docstring-staleness audit (verifier reproduced). tree-sitter-sql~=0.3.11 has no `create_procedure` node kind; `CREATE PROCEDURE foo() LANGUAGE plpgsql AS $$ BEGIN END $$;` parses as ERROR nodes. The `create_procedure` branch (~L360-388) is entirely `# pragma: no cover` and can never fire; a scratch file with a table, FK table, index, trigger and procedure yields no procedure symbol. Options: extract procedures from the ERROR-recovered tokens / a text fallback, or drop the branch and the docstring claim. Docstring updated in the audit PR to say procedures are not extracted."  # 4fec
